        "TileImage": "$($repository fd5e4b5f-ade1-4323-8622-823b48685b9f).Image",
        "Description": "I had a feeling we would be returning to Bangkok sometime soon, 47. This time we&apos;re here to rid the world of Jackie Carrington &amp; her two associates Susanne Ayeran and Khun Mae Anund, who can both be found on cleaning duty for the hotel. It seems they&apos;ve come to some sort of arrangement with the management that&apos;s allowed them permanent residence there. Perhaps you might be able to persuade them to relocate somehow. Good Luck",
